<title>USA: Texas Meridian Resources Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Texas Meridian Resources Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Meridian Resources Corporation (NYSE: TMR) today reported financial results for 1st Quarter 1997.</p>
<p>		    1st Qtr 1997	 1st Qtr 1996	  Change</p>
<p>		    (unaudited)	   (unaudited)</p>
<p>Production:</p>
<p>    Oil (MBbls)	    153		     87	     76%</p>
<p>   Gas (MMCF)	    1,442		  1,246	     16%</p>
<p>   Revenues:	   $ 8,329		$ 5,079	     64%</p>
<p> Earnings:		 2,099		  1,375	     53%</p>
<p>    per share:	    0.13		   0.09	     44%</p>
<p> Cash flow:		5,386		  3,672	     60%</p>
<p>    per share:	    0.37		   0.23	     61%</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
